BEGIN
  -- Addition Layer input adjustment for 
  -- Quantization
  -- Quantization of Adder 
  -- Output
  -- AND payloadValid signal with state_out == 1
  -- in order to ensure the payloadValid goes high when the
  -- state machine is ready to deal with it.
  -- output FIFO
  -- Input FIFOs
  -- pipeline read FIFOs
  -- count the number of received data in order to 
  -- distribute them to different FIFOs
  -- 1. Once there is a datum in the input FIFOs, they will be pushed out and then add up together, finally store into 
  -- the output FIF
  -- 2.  If the number of data stored in the output FIFO is greater than a certain burst value,
  -- we keep sending out the data into DDR through the output processor 
  -- ReLU
  -- 1. Input processor request the data from DDR 
  -- 2. Requests sent are pipelined
  -- 3. Interleavely sending out read requests from 2 different address and then distribute it to input FIFO A and input 
  -- FIFO 

